5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's figure out a way to split the bills that feels fair for everyone now that we're five! I'll look into the last twelve utility statements and the sunlight and heating need by room.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to understand the long-term costs and any potential setup fees. I'll look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see how other people do it! I'll check the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll see if the rumors about people carrying each other are true. I'll look into the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to see how the actual payments have affected us. I'll look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the kitchen notice about the cooler.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
